    {
      "flavor_text": "からだの　よこがわにある　ラインは\nたいようのひかりを　ためておける。\nよるになると　あざやかに　かがやく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸의 옆쪽에 있는 줄에\n태양의 빛을 모아둘 수 있다.\n밤이 되면 아름답게 빛난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie\nsolaire et brille dans la nuit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Linie an seiner Seite kann Sonnenlicht\nspeichern. Nachts leuchtet es sehr intensiv.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La línea que le recorre el costado puede almacenar\nluz solar. Brilla con mucha fuerza por la noche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La linea che contorna il suo corpo immagazzina la\nluce solare. Di notte si illumina di una luce splendente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The line running down its side can store sunlight.\nIt shines vividly at night.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体の　横側にある　ラインは\n太陽の光を　ためておける。\n夜になると　鮮やかに　輝く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La línea que le recorre el costado puede almacenar\nluz solar. Brilla con mucha fuerza por la noche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいようを　いっぱいに　あびた\nおびれの　もようは　くらくなると\nあざやかな　いろで　ひかりだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "햇볕을 잔뜩 쬔 꼬리지느러미의\n무늬는 어두워지면 선명한 색으로\n반짝이기 시작한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Après une longue exposition au soleil, les motifs de\nses nageoires caudales luisent à la nuit tombée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wurden die Flossen lange dem Sonnenlicht\nausgesetzt, leuchten sie in der Dunkelheit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si se expone mucho al sol, los dibujos de sus aletas\nbrillan en la oscuridad.",
